      "expected": "A controller should use one MCU for these shared signals, or provide explicit selection/isolation if the devices are alternatives. Two active MCUs should not have their I/O pins directly paralleled without a defined arrangement.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "PWM : C3.2(passive) J4.1(MISO,passive) R2.1(passive) U2.6(PB1,bidirectional) U3.6(PB1,bidirectional)"
