        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "an ATtiny-driven fan controller"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "If both MCUs are active, their outputs can contend on shared signals, and shared programming/reset connections may also prevent reliable independent programming or operation.",
      "confidence": 0.94
    }
